    <description>DIR-1258 AC6: Deactivation approval process for a Residential Payment Plan Product2 record. Single-level approval - assignee Group is a PLACEHOLDER (RES_Operations_Group) pending business confirmation of the real deactivation-approver role/group (story explicitly calls this an open item). Reassigning the real approver later is a one-field metadata change (the assignee Group name in the Deactivation_Approval_Step below), no flow logic change. Self-triggers off RES_Payment_Plan_Deactivation_Requested__c flipping true, which the Request Deactivation screen flow only allows once a supporting document is attached (audit trail).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>GroupBellNotificationBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Payment Plan &apos;&quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot;&apos; deactivation requires your approval.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>SubmitterDeactivatedBellBody</name>
